gizli bir malzeme olsaydı{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Ama hey,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} onsuz da yeterince
