IT:
Allora, finalmente abbiamo messo in
cantiere anche la portata principale.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Uff, che gran sollievo, non trovi?!
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Comunque sia, adesso è il turno
del dessert, il preferito di tutti!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Userò {{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0100}},{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} e{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0300}}, OK?
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sono certo di poter creare
{{TAG:000E:0002:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0012:0005:00CD}}
{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}davvero indimenticabile!
{{TAG:0003:0020:}}Buona fortuna per questa tua ultima
caccia agli ingredienti!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Thanks to you,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} I came up with what
might be the absolute greatest
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0012:0005:00CD}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} of my life!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}The main ingredients were good,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}but it was the secret ingredient
that gave it the amazing flavor!{{TAG:0003:0001:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0003:}}Grâce à toi,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} j'ai réussi à mitonner {{TAG:000E:0008:00CD04006C00650004006C0061000000}}
meilleur{{TAG:000E:0008:00CD0000020065000000}} {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}{{TAG:0012:0005:00CD}}{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}
